 "text": "Hi! How's everything going? Bread, cheese, fruit, bacon or bacon fat crisps, crisps, burgers, eggs, oats, porridge, rice, sandwiches and snacks like crackers. If it' kept cool, a few hours is usually fine. Cook it just before you leave, so it' not sitting at room temperature. You could, or bring a frozen chicken thigh and cook it on the spot. A tray of pies and cakes is perfect, but keep them in the shade. Lemon and ginger biscuits are easy and nobody notices if they melt.",
